{"id":"16ae22435ebdf5f5","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound.md","title":"Fixed-Point Values Determined by Bounded Characters","display":"lem-fixed-point-character-bound — Fixed-Point Values Determined by Bounded Characters","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound","aliases":["89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-fixed-point-character-bound — Fixed-Point Values Determined by Bounded Characters","depends_on":["[[89-lem-modal-character-partition]]","[[89-df-modalized]]","[[89-df-dotted-box]]","[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]","[[89-df-modal-degree]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-fixed-point-character-bound — Fixed-Point Values Determined by Bounded Characters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9fe494d9579129b3\" href=\"?note=9fe494d9579129b3\" title=\"89-lem-modal-character-partition\">89-lem-modal-character-partition</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"138d8c34e0370a6b\" href=\"?note=138d8c34e0370a6b\" title=\"89-df-modalized\">89-df-modalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"95a48b6ae42f7e48\" href=\"?note=95a48b6ae42f7e48\" title=\"89-df-dotted-box\">89-df-dotted-box</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"437e16026e9e0691\" href=\"?note=437e16026e9e0691\" title=\"89-df-finite-frame-rank\">89-df-finite-frame-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"04ea1c6ff126f884\" href=\"?note=04ea1c6ff126f884\" title=\"89-df-modal-degree\">89-df-modal-degree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}\\)</span> 的固定有序枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=b_{\\Box}(A)\">\\(n=b_{\\Box}(A)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(W,R,V)\">\\(M=(W,R,V)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=(X,S,U)\">\\(N=(X,S,U)\\)</span> 为有限 GL 模型，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in X\">\\(x\\in X\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{Q,n}\">\\(\\chi_{Q,n}\\)</span> 为唯一 character 选择，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+\">\\(\\Box^+\\)</span> 为 dotted box。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,w\\models\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\">\\(M,w\\models\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N,x\\models\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\">\\(N,x\\models\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}character\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\chi_{Q,n}(M,w)=\\chi_{Q,n}(N,x)\n\\Longrightarrow(M,w\\models p\\Longleftrightarrow N,x\\models p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}character\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\chi_{Q,n}(M,w)=\\chi_{Q,n}(N,x)\n\\Longrightarrow(M,w\\models p\\Longleftrightarrow N,x\\models p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 114–115；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>这是原书 Lemma 8 的计数论证。若根的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 值不同，两条方程使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 值不同；共同 character 保证其他字母同值，模态化使某个盒子公式不同。维持不变量：已选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span> 个不同盒子公式，在两当前世界均真；当前世界从各根可达（允许根自身）；两世界的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(n-k)\">\\((n-k)\\)</span>-character 相同；另有一个不在已选集合的盒子公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box D\">\\(\\Box D\\)</span> 失配。\n假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box D\">\\(\\Box D\\)</span> 在第一个世界假、第二个真。在第一个模型当前后继中，选一个最低秩的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 假世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span>。它的后继全部使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 真，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\models\\Box D\">\\(v\\models\\Box D\\)</span>。character 匹配给第二模型同低一阶 character 的后继 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span>，在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\Box D\">\\(D,\\Box D\\)</span> 均真。两世界继承以前为真的盒子公式；于是把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box D\">\\(\\Box D\\)</span> 加入，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k+1\">\\(k+1\\)</span> 个共同真盒。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 失配经布尔分解、两条 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=A\">\\(p=A\\)</span> 方程与共同字母值，再给一个新的失配盒。\n重复到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=n\">\\(k=n\\)</span> 要求在全部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个已共同为真的盒之外还有失配盒，矛盾。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时，最初从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 失配推出盒失配已直接矛盾。没有使用待证明的不动点存在性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-modal-character-partition","status":"resolved","id":"9fe494d9579129b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-modal-character-partition]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modalized","status":"resolved","id":"138d8c34e0370a6b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-dotted-box","status":"resolved","id":"95a48b6ae42f7e48","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-dotted-box]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite-frame-rank","status":"resolved","id":"437e16026e9e0691","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-degree","status":"resolved","id":"04ea1c6ff126f884","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-degree]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(A)\\setminus\\{p\\}","display":false},{"tex":"n=b_{\\Box}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"M=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"N=(X,S,U)","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in X","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{Q,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+","display":false},{"tex":"M,w\\models\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)","display":false},{"tex":"N,x\\models\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}character\\text{-}bound}\\vdash\n\\chi_{Q,n}(M,w)=\\chi_{Q,n}(N,x)\n\\Longrightarrow(M,w\\models p\\Longleftrightarrow N,x\\models p).","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"(n-k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"v\\models\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"D,\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"k+1","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"p=A","display":false},{"tex":"k=n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"n=0","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":2346,"backlinks":[{"id":"4ba460c900107e00","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-90","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般有限构造：[[89-df-modal-degree]] → [[89-df-modal-characters]] → [[89-lem-modal-character-partition]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound]] → [[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["9fe494d9579129b3","138d8c34e0370a6b","95a48b6ae42f7e48","437e16026e9e0691","04ea1c6ff126f884"]}